/KM8 FUNCTIONS
/
NOEMB,	DCA FLDCNT	/START WITH FIELD 0
	JMS LGLFLD	/GO TEST FOR VALID SELECTION
	JMS LEGALA
	ISZ FLDCNT	/UPDATE FIELD NUMBER
	TAD FLDCNT	/GET BACK FIELD SELECTION
	AND SR911	/ISOLATE FIELD
	CLL RTL 
	RAL 		/MOVE INTO POSITION
	DCA TSTFLD	/SAVE NEW VALUE
	TAD TSTFLD
	SZA CLA 	/GONE BACK TO ZERO?
	JMP NOEMB+1	/GO BACK AND TRY AGAIN
	JMP ILEGAL	/INVALID SELECTIONS OR NOT ENOUGH
