CFP3,	TAD CFPTMP	/DF < STARTF ***
	CIA
	TAD ENDF
	SNA
	JMP CFP1	/DF = ENDF (SELECTED)
	SPA CLA 
	JMP CFP0	/DF > ENDF (NOT SELECTED)
	JMP CFP1	/DF < ENDF (SELECTED)
CFP4,	TAD CFPTMP	/STARTF < ENDF
	CIA
	TAD STARTF	/DF = STARTF (SELECTED)
	SNA
	JMP CFP1	/DF = STARTF (SELECTED)
	SPA CLA 
	JMP CFP3	/DF > STARTF THIS TIME ***
	JMP CFP0	/DF < STARTF (NOT SELECTED)
