/ROUTINE TO CHECK FOR CONSOLE PACKAGE ACTIVE
/
/IF CONSOLE PACKAGE ACTIVE, GO TO CONSOLE PACKAGE
/RETURN CALL + 2
/
/IF CONSOLE PACKAGE NOT ACTIVE, RETURN CALL + 1
/
XC8CAL,	0
	DCA CHRTMP	/SAVE AC
	TAD HCW2	/GET HCW2
	AND K400	/TEST FOR BIT 3=1 CONSOLE ACTIVE
	SZA CLA
	JMP .+3		/CONSOLE IS ACTIVE
	TAD CHRTMP	/GET BACK THE CHARACTER
	JMP I XC8CAL	/AND EXIT.
	RIF		/READ INSTRUCTION FIELD
	TAD (OFFSET	/ADD CONSOLE PACKAGE FIELD OFFSET
	TAD (CIF	/ADD CIF INSTRUCTION CODE
	DCA .+1		/SAVE MODIFIED CIF FOR EXECUTION
	HLT		/MODIFIED CIF TO CONSOLE PACKAGE FIELD
	TAD CHRTMP	/RESTORE AC
	JMS I C8LOC	/GO TO CONSOLE PACKAGE
	ISZ XC8CAL	/INCREMENT RETURN ADDRESS
	JMP I XC8CAL	/RETURN CALL + 2 CONSOLE WAS ACTIVE
/
