	SMA CLA 	/APT/SKP IF YES
	JMP APTOK0
	IOF		/APT/
	RIF		/APT/AC=IF.
	TAD [6203	/APT/CREAD A CDF INST.
	DCA I APTOK1	/APT/SET UP APT CODE CDF
	TAD I APTOK1
	DCA .+1		/APT/MODIFY NEXT LOC.
	CDF 0		/APT/(MODIFIED CDF) DF=CURRENT IF.
	NOP
	JMS 6500	/APT/CALL APT - "PROG OK".
	JMP I APTOK	/APT/RTN FROM APT - RETURN TO CALL+1.
